| ML Model Type              | Short Use                                       |
| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Supervised Learning        | Predict output using labeled data               |
| Unsupervised Learning      | Find hidden patterns in data                    |
| Reinforcement Learning     | Learn through rewards and penalties             |
| Semi-Supervised Learning   | Train with small labeled + large unlabeled data |
| Self-Supervised Learning   | Learn patterns automatically from data          |
| Deep Learning              | Handle complex tasks like image, voice, NLP     |
| Generative AI Models       | Generate text, images, videos, music            |
|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|

